  "entry": "code/index.html",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A browser tool that takes a raw gel image and turns it into a journal-ready, labelled figure. It straightens and crops the gel, finds the lanes, identifies the ladder, adds annotations, runs an image-integrity check and exports the figure with a processing log. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
